            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nThis is expected behavior. Those indicators are for empty tabstops (both regular and final). They persist across all mode changes [until snippet session is stopped](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4630b9cb783b280fa0fd94e8245d8fb06023f3ba/doc/mini-snippets.txt#L1016-L1018), which can be done [in several ways](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4630b9cb783b280fa0fd94e8245d8fb06023f3ba/doc/mini-snippets.txt#L1065-L1077). So either:\n- Navigate through the whole snippet up to the final tabstop and 1) press `<Esc>`; or 2) type text.\n- Press `<C-c>` to stop snippet session.\n\nThis is documented [here](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4630b9cb783b280fa0fd94e8245d8fb06023f3ba/doc/mini-snippets.txt#L1085-L1088).",
